{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0332-s001", "text": "På fritiden kan människor utöva aktiviteter som de tycker om.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0332-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.290924072265625, "generation_seconds": 20.135835794033483, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:37:16.402210+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0332-s002", "text": "I Finland har både barn och vuxna ofta fritidsintressen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0332-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.261993408203125, "generation_seconds": 19.460269680945203, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:37:50.005671+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0332-s003", "text": "Fritidsintressen kan vara både organiserad verksamhet och aktiviteter på egen hand.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0332-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.558197021484375, "generation_seconds": 26.50886385794729, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:38:23.572619+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0332-s004", "text": "På fritiden använder människorna ofta också olika närtjänster.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0332-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.256805419921875, "generation_seconds": 21.45457603293471, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:38:57.157679+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0332-s005", "text": "Sådana är till exempel bibliotek, motionstjänster, ungdomsgårdar och invånarhus.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0332-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.246826171875, "generation_seconds": 26.979985316982493, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0332-s006", "text": "Också att besöka olika kulturevenemang är ett bra sätt att tillbringa fritiden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0332-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.2606201171875, "generation_seconds": 24.593355347868055, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:39:30.742970+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0333-s001", "text": "I Finland har staten som officiellt mål att alla barn och unga ska ha åtminstone en rolig hobby.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0333-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.64697265625, "generation_seconds": 26.626350632170215, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:40:04.332228+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0333-s002", "text": "Kommunerna ordnar olika typer av kostnadsfri hobbyverksamhet i samband med skoldagen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0333-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.592925170068027, "peak": 0.25408935546875, "generation_seconds": 27.72681938088499, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:40:34.336936+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0333-s003", "text": "Dessa kostnadsfria hobbyer kan vara till exempel motions-, musik- eller konstklubbar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0333-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.332366943359375, "generation_seconds": 26.479462372139096, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:41:07.919554+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0333-s004", "text": "Kommunerna ordnar hobbyverksamhet för barn också på andra tider, men de kan vara avgiftsbelagda.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0333-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.32415771484375, "generation_seconds": 30.56483506783843, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:41:41.507288+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0334-s001", "text": "Motion och idrott är populära hobbyer, och man kan utöva många idrotts- och motionsgrenar på egen hand.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0334-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.2767333984375, "generation_seconds": 34.03168830019422, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:42:15.094124+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0334-s002", "text": "Till exempel kan man ta en joggingtur när det passar en själv bäst.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0334-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.331085205078125, "generation_seconds": 17.948030184954405, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:42:48.676842+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0334-s003", "text": "Man kan också delta i ledd motionsverksamhet i en idrottsförening eller till exempel i kurser vid ett medborgarinstitut.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0334-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.448979591836734, "peak": 0.295623779296875, "generation_seconds": 38.28086707089096, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:43:22.265677+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0334-s004", "text": "Medborgarinstituten ordnar också olika kurser i bildkonst, handarbete och språk som många har som hobby att delta i.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0334-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.961360544217687, "peak": 0.372100830078125, "generation_seconds": 35.12502917693928, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:43:55.843516+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0334-s005", "text": "Föreningsverksamhet är en populär hobby i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0334-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.276153564453125, "generation_seconds": 18.079141960013658, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:44:29.433450+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0335-s001", "text": "I Finland förvaltar kommunerna många lokaler och tjänster som kan användas av alla kommuninvånare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0335-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.379730224609375, "generation_seconds": 28.30159768019803, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0335-s002", "text": "Att använda dem är förmånligt eller kostnadsfritt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0335-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.49310302734375, "generation_seconds": 16.77852471615188, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:45:03.019785+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0335-s003", "text": "Utöver kommunerna förvaltar också olika föreningar lokaler och tjänster som är öppna för alla.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0335-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.498503401360544, "peak": 0.493865966796875, "generation_seconds": 33.8162370279897, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:45:36.599813+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
2026-11-03T04:46:10.208572+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0336-s001", "text": "I Finland ordnar till exempel idrottsföreningar och privata företag olika typer av idrotts- och motionsverksamhet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0336-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.448979591836734, "peak": 0.26910400390625, "generation_seconds": 34.32882874994539, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:46:43.777746+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0336-s002", "text": "Också kommunerna erbjuder många olika slags motionstjänster, till exempel förmånliga simhalls- och gymtjänster och olika former av gruppträning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0336-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.399455782312925, "peak": 0.25604248046875, "generation_seconds": 36.707848242949694, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:47:17.369568+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0336-s003", "text": "Kommunerna förvaltar idrottsplaner och inomhushallar, som det ofta är möjligt att hyra för sin egen hobbygrupp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0336-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.47374149659864, "peak": 0.342987060546875, "generation_seconds": 22.95258592814207, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:47:51.059447+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0337-s001", "text": "Inom kommunernas motionstjänster, till exempel i simhallar, erbjuds i allmänhet sänkta priser för barn, pensionärer, studerande och arbetslösa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0337-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.538775510204081, "peak": 0.383209228515625, "generation_seconds": 36.16625304007903, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0337-s002", "text": "I en del simhallar är vissa tider reserverade endast för kvinnor.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0337-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.266998291015625, "generation_seconds": 18.95219261595048, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:48:21.060630+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0337-s003", "text": "I simhallarna finns det också en bastu i anslutning till omklädnings- och tvättrummen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0337-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.592925170068027, "peak": 0.3624267578125, "generation_seconds": 18.995547574944794, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:48:54.529033+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0337-s004", "text": "Det finns separata bastur för män och kvinnor, och man badar vanligtvis naken.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0337-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.296295166015625, "generation_seconds": 17.507635505171493, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:49:28.115621+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0338-s001", "text": "I bostadsområden och byar finns invånarhus och -lokaler där många olika typer av verksamhet ordnas för invånarna i området.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0338-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.797278911564625, "peak": 0.295745849609375, "generation_seconds": 26.972565995994955, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0338-s002", "text": "Lokalerna kan förvaltas av kommunen eller olika föreningar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0338-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.33966064453125, "generation_seconds": 18.1763575989753, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:50:01.709251+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0338-s003", "text": "Verksamheten kan vara till exempel klubbar och fria grupper.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0338-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.32037353515625, "generation_seconds": 14.505474992096424, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0338-s004", "text": "Det är ofta möjligt att hyra lokalerna för eget bruk, till exempel familjefester.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0338-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.3157958984375, "generation_seconds": 23.45144252688624, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:50:35.287111+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
2026-11-03T04:51:08.869752+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0339-s001", "text": "På sina områden upprätthåller kommunerna också parker och andra grönområden, lekparker för barn samt allmänna badstränder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0339-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.448979591836734, "peak": 0.389739990234375, "generation_seconds": 35.77670891606249, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0339-s002", "text": "Dessa är platser som är öppna för alla och där människor fritt kan tillbringa tid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0339-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.449462890625, "generation_seconds": 25.298635320039466, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:51:42.470448+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
2026-11-03T04:52:16.054244+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0339-s003", "text": "Även om områdena sköts och underhålls, ansvarar alla som använder dem för att de är prydliga och trivsamma.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0339-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.682721088435374, "peak": 0.563720703125, "generation_seconds": 41.34984568390064, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:52:49.758321+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0339-s004", "text": "Därför är det viktigt att alla till exempel plockar upp sitt eget skräp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0339-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.549346923828125, "generation_seconds": 26.424175203079358, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0340-s001", "text": "I Finland finns det många slags hobbyer för barn och unga.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0340-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.232818603515625, "generation_seconds": 20.852840461069718, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:53:23.347193+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0340-s002", "text": "Barn och unga kan till exempel idrotta, dansa, spela musik, utöva bildkonst eller teater.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0340-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.324188232421875, "generation_seconds": 29.001018644077703, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:53:56.815872+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0340-s003", "text": "En del hobbyer är avgiftsbelagda men det finns även gratis hobbyer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0340-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.2938232421875, "generation_seconds": 23.83749325410463, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:54:30.398488+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0341-s001", "text": "Kommuner, organisationer, medborgarinstitut och privata organisationer ordnar ledd verksamhet för barn och unga.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0341-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.961360544217687, "peak": 0.285614013671875, "generation_seconds": 33.257134831976146, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:55:03.997365+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0342-s001", "text": "Tjänsterna inom kommunernas ungdomsarbete är avsedda för barn och unga vuxna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0342-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.30364990234375, "generation_seconds": 20.566045531071723, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:55:37.575947+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0342-s002", "text": "Unga kan delta i olika klubbar och den öppna verksamheten på ungdomsgårdarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0342-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.313720703125, "generation_seconds": 17.286529512144625, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0342-s003", "text": "Ungdomsgården är ett ställe där ungdomarna kan tillbringa tid och idka olika aktiviteter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0342-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.30816650390625, "generation_seconds": 25.62216401891783, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:56:07.587336+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0342-s004", "text": "På ungdomsgårdarna ordnas alltid också ledd verksamhet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0342-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.015510204081632, "peak": 0.386260986328125, "generation_seconds": 18.543633336899802, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:56:41.170297+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0342-s005", "text": "Största delen av verksamheten på ungdomsgårdarna är gratis.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0342-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.338653564453125, "generation_seconds": 24.033072284888476, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:57:14.766981+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0343-s001", "text": "På ungdomsgården finns alltid en vuxen, oftast kommunens ungdomsarbetare eller ungdomsledare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0343-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.347442626953125, "generation_seconds": 28.40890091797337, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0343-s002", "text": "Åldersgränserna på ungdomsgårdarna varierar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0343-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.249251700680272, "peak": 0.30828857421875, "generation_seconds": 14.419981562066823, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:57:48.340669+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0343-s003", "text": "Verksamheten ordnas utifrån ungdomarnas egna önskemål och ungdomarna kan själv påverka innehållet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0343-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.361968994140625, "generation_seconds": 27.083147044060752, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:58:21.922377+00:00 hb-c11-fritid tts: PID 151163 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0344-s001", "text": "Du får mer information om kommunens ungdomsarbete hos ungdomsväsendet i din hemkommun.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-fritid/narration/hb-c11-u0344-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.383945578231293, "peak": 0.270965576171875, "generation_seconds": 23.713286996120587, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
